<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">0.439<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">实验现象：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">．实验一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>1%</SPAN>淀粉溶液和含<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.3%NaCL</SPAN>的<SPAN lang=EN-US>1%</SPAN>淀粉溶液均在沸水浴<SPAN lang=EN-US>3min</SPAN>左右溶液开始逐渐由混浊变透明；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; tab-stops: center 117.8pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">实验二中<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>组颜色为蓝色，<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>两组均为淡紫红色<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></TD>
<TD style="BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; WIDTH: 172.6pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1" vAlign=top width=230>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">我们的理由：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; tab-stops: 33.0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">淀粉在常温下不溶于水<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>但是当温度上升到<SPAN lang=EN-US>53</SPAN>度以上时<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>会发生溶涨，形成均匀的粘稠糊状溶液，本质是淀粉分子间的氢键断开，分散在水中形成胶体溶液，形成透明或半透明溶液，透光性越好，说明溶解性越好；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">与蒸馏水、<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.3%NaCL</SPAN>溶液的透光值比较，甲、乙两组无明显差异，说明两组溶液中淀粉的溶解情况相似<SPAN lang=EN-US>;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; tab-stops: 33.0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">淀粉遇碘液变蓝，淀粉含量越高，颜色越深；实验二中，吸光值<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>组〉<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>组〉<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>组，差异显著，说明<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>组淀粉水解慢<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>酶活性小于<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>组<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">由表可知该组同学基于实验数据，根据实验原理进行逻辑推理，肯定了假设</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，否定了假设</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，即主张：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>0.3%NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在《探究酶的专一性实验》中的作用是提高淀粉酶的活性。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2.4</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋">论证会议阶段</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">学生在此阶段要以小组形式向全班分享他们的论证，对自己的主张、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">解释和理由进行辩护和完善。继续以上述论证为例，其它小组学生提出的质疑如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>：虽然实验结果支持<SPAN lang=EN-US>NaCL</SPAN>是</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=Calibri>α</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">-</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">淀粉酶的激活剂，但教材中该实验是探究酶的专一性而不是高效性，<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>：《探究酶的专一性》实验在观察淀粉能否被不同酶水解时，现象差异十分显著，没有必要额外使用酶的激活剂<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>：教材中用的是唾液，人体唾液中除了唾液淀粉酶，应该也存在少量的钠离子、氯离子，为什么还要添加<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.3%NaCL</SPAN>作为激活剂？<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>：我有查到文献指出少量盐可以促进淀粉溶液的糊化，也就是溶解，因为少量的盐离子结合在淀粉分子周围，可以增加其与水分子的亲和性<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>D</SPAN>：也许<SPAN lang=EN-US>1%</SPAN>淀粉溶液中，淀粉含量少，只要沸水浴加热足够时间都能溶解，所以甲、乙两组实验现象差异不显著。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">生<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>：我认为在《探究酶的专一性》实验中加不加<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.3%NaCL</SPAN>并不重要，不影响实验结果。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">从对话中，我们可以看出学生</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>A</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">和</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>B</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">非常犀利的指出该小组在初步论证过程中的漏洞，并进一步用事实“唾液中原本也存在少量钠离子和氯离子”质疑主张的可靠性，最后提出了自己的新观点：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>0.3% NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在《探究酶的专一性》实验中对实验结果没有影响。学生</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>C</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">根据化学的知识，指出为什么少量盐可以增加淀粉的溶解性，但是学生</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>D</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">从实验操作的角度解释为什么加入</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>0.3% NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">对</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1%</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">淀粉溶液溶解度改善不显著。学生借助论证会议中的对话，从他人那里得到不同的认识，并逐步内化讨论的结果，进而重新构建自己的主张，可见这样的学习过程能让学生在整体中思考为什么进行探究，有利于其批判性思维的培养。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2.5 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋">反思讨论阶段</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在听取他人的论证过程后，学生回归自己的小组，反思他们之前遇到的信息冲突，全面审视自己的论证过程。在这一阶段，学生思考产生了对话，同时对话也促进了思考，不同的学生从不同的角度对数据进行分析，通过对话形成了“反思场”。在这一过程中，教师还可以引导学生对“酶”的科学概念进行梳理并深入思考一些问题，如：酶为什么具有专一性？影响酶活性的因素有哪些？淀粉的溶解性对酶促反应是否有影响？为什么淀粉常温下较难溶解？通过对这些问题的思考与讨论可以帮助学生进行深度学习。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2.6</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 华文仿宋">同伴互评及修改阶段<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">考虑到学生课余时间有限，将</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>ADI</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">教学模型的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">三个阶段进行简化处理，没有让学生撰写研究报告，而是以完善</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">“证主张表”替代，论证主张表不但可以为学生分析问题和论证过程提供一个完整的支架，也有利于教师的评价和小组间的互评。案例中呈现论证过程的小组经过修改，完善了他们的主张，即</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>0.3%NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在《探究酶的专一性》实验中的作用应该是促进淀粉溶解，但是促进溶解的效果并不显著，只要加热足够时间，不加入</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">也不会影响实验结果。甚至有一个小组进一步完善了实验方案，提出主张：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>0.3%NaCL</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">虽然对</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1%</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">淀粉溶液的溶解度影响不大，但是可以在一定程度上防止淀粉老化，即淀粉分子的重新析出，有利于实验进行，并补充提出建议：实验中</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1%</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">淀粉溶液最好现配现用。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">结语</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在传统的生物实验教学中，过于强调课本实验的操作步骤和实验操作技能的掌握，这不但不属于真正意义上的探究性学习，而且更无法培养学生的批判性思维。在基于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>ADI</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">教学模型的教学实践中，突出学生的主体地位，营造开放的学习环境，形成“探究共同体”，借助对话与讨论进行反思，这种反思能增加论证的深度与广度，尤其当对话过程中产生思维矛盾时，是发展学生批判性思维的良好契机。这种教学模式不但培养了学生的科学论证能力和实事求是的科学态度，也将有限的课堂教学内容与批判性思维培养进行了有效整合。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                        </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">主要参考文献</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">[1]</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">杨帆，徐连清，王健．批判性思维能力的培养与考查［<SPAN lang=EN-US>M</SPAN>］．北京<SPAN lang=EN-US>: </SPAN>高等教育出版社，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2014:9<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">[2] Kuhn. D.Thinking<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>as <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>argumcnl[J].Harvard<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>Educational<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>Review,<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>1992,<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>62:155-178.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">[3]</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">陈玉玲<SPAN lang=EN-US>. ADI</SPAN>教学模式在高中生物实验教学中的应用研究<SPAN lang=EN-US>[D].</SPAN>闽南师范大学<SPAN lang=EN-US>,2019.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm -38.2pt 0cm 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-para-margin-right: -3.64gd"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">[4]</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">何嘉媛，王璇，刘恩山<SPAN lang=EN-US>. </SPAN>基于论证探究式教学模型的行动研究<SPAN lang=EN-US>[J].</SPAN>生物学通报，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2013</SPAN>，<SPAN lang=EN-US>48</SPAN>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>）：<SPAN lang=EN-US>21-27.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
